To inspect from top (a whole number) with column (a whole number).
Set valid to 1.
The base is top times columns plus column.
The stamp is top times columns plus column plus 1.
The northwest is item base of grid.
The north is item (base plus 1) of grid.
The northeast is item (base plus 2) of grid.
The west is item (base plus columns) of grid.
The middle is item (base plus columns plus 1) of grid.
The east is item (base plus columns plus 2) of grid.
The southwest is item (base plus columns plus columns) of grid.
The south is item (base plus columns plus columns plus 1) of grid.
The southeast is item (base plus columns plus columns plus 2) of grid.
If northwest is less than 1 or northwest is more than 9, return.
