The firstrow is northwest plus north plus northeast.
The secondrow is west plus middle plus east.
The thirdrow is southwest plus south plus southeast.
The firstcolumn is northwest plus west plus southwest.
The secondcolumn is north plus middle plus south.
The thirdcolumn is northeast plus east plus southeast.
The diagonal is northwest plus middle plus southeast.
The cross is northeast plus middle plus southwest.
If valid is 1 and firstrow is 15 and secondrow is 15 and thirdrow is 15 and firstcolumn is 15 and secondcolumn is 15 and thirdcolumn is 15 and diagonal is 15 and cross is 15, add 1 to total.

